  m_text: "\"Since 1944, Loi Ah Koon served more than just toast\u2014he served warmth.
    But printed posters can only tell half the story. We\u2019ve used AR to awaken
    the history sleeping within them. Scan the images around you to watch the past
    sizzle to life and master the craft of a true Kopi legend.\""
